      "url": "https://gymvisual.com/videos/14628-bench-dip-knees-bent.html",
      "listing": "Video; data sheet: body part Upper Arms, equipment Body weight, exercise type Strength",
      "note": "Reference used only to identify the movement. No GymVisual media is stored here; this rig, model and animation are original."
    },
